The marks of the model providers, one SVG a provider, drawn in one colour (`currentColor`) on a 24 by 24 grid and
painted by the page as a mask (`.provider-mark`), so they take the colour of the text around them.

- anthropic.svg (the Claude mark, worn by the Anthropic provider's models), ollama.svg: from Simple Icons
  (https://simpleicons.org), released under CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
